@page "/about-project"
@using MudBlazor
@inject NavigationManager Navigation

<PageTitle>About Project</PageTitle>


<MudPaper Class="p-4">
    <MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Class="mb-4">About the Project</MudText>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.body1">
        This project provides an intuitive and interactive platform with the following features:
    </MudText>

    <MudList T="String" Class="mb-4">
        <MudListItem>
            <b>To-Do Page:</b> Users can add, complete, and delete tasks. The interface is designed to ensure ease of use while managing personal tasks.
        </MudListItem>
        <MudListItem>
            <b>Weather Page:</b> Integrated with the OpenWeather API, users can search for current weather conditions. They can also set a favorite city and weather type for quick access.
        </MudListItem>
        <MudListItem>
            <b>Personalized Alerts:</b> Once logged in, users receive notifications about their favorite weather condition in their chosen city. The alert includes the expected time and date, ensuring users stay informed.
        </MudListItem>
    </MudList>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.body1">
        The platform aims to enhance user productivity by combining task management with real-time weather updates, making it both practical and user-friendly.
    </MudText>

    <MudSpacer />

    <MudCard Class="mt-4" Style="background-color: #f9f9f9;">
        <MudCardHeader>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.h6">Why This Project?</MudText>
        </MudCardHeader>
        <MudCardContent>
            <MudText Typo="Typo.body2">
                This project is designed to merge daily planning with real-time information. Whether you're managing a busy schedule or planning outdoor activities, the integration of tasks and weather updates in one platform simplifies your routine.
            </MudText>
        </MudCardContent>
    </MudCard>
</MudPaper>
